{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s party time at the PAW Patrol Grand Prix, and you and up to three pup pals  are invited! Rev up for PAWsome fun as you compete to collect the most pup treats, before the time runs out. And use amazing PAW Patrol power-ups to gain pup treats and take the lead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/PPGP_DLC2_Pawsome_PowerUps_ENG_615X70.png?t=1727088085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use any skill, like Everest\u2019s Snowballs, Tracker's Grabber Arm, and Ryder's Invincibility Shield, to outdo other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/PAWsome_Power-ups.gif?t=1727088085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/PPGP_DLC2_Exciting_Arenas_ENG_615X70.png?t=1727088085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle in Adventure Bay, the Jungle, and Jake\u2019s Snowboarding Resort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/Exciting_Arenas.gif?t=1727088085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Ryder and the pups in battle arenas at three iconic PAW Patrol locations  \u2013 Adventure Bay, the Jungle, and Jake\u2019s Snowboarding Resort. Any pup can pick up any power-up in these high-speed battles, like Everest\u2019s Snowballs, Tracker's Grabber Arm, and Ryder's Invincibility Shield, so there are countless ways to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/PPGP_DLC2_Any_pup_can_win_ENG_615X70.png?t=1727088085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your speed and power-ups or grab the Golden Pup Treat to win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/Any_pup_can_win.gif?t=1727088085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Time running out? Try to grab the Golden Pup Treat, which drops into the center of the arena close to the end of the battle! Whether you try to be the fastest collector, the best pup treat collector, or first to the Golden Pup Treat, no pup is too small to win at this racing party!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/PPGP_DLC2_Solo_and_Multiplayer_Fun_ENG_615X70.png?t=1727088085\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy local 4-player battles or take on AI-powered pup pals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/extras/Multiplayer_Fun.gif?t=1727088085\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2230640?t=1727088085","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1727088085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1727088085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2230640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1727088085","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"des